        {
          "text": "Mpawo wakabweedezezya banyina mali aansiliva aali myanda iili ikumi aumwi, alimwi banyina bakati, Aya mali aansiliva aali mujanza lyangu ndaabila Jehova nkaambo kamwanaangu, kuti tucite cikozyano cibezedwe acikozyano cifulidwe. Lino ndaabweedezya mumaanza aako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
