              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino kakuli umwi mukubusi waku-Betelehemu mucisi ca-Juda, kali wamusyobo wa-Juda, alimwi kali mu-Levi iwakali kukala-kala nkuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyu muntu wakalonga kuzwa ku-Betelehemu mucisi ca-Juda, wali kuya buyandaula busena bwakukala. Elyo mukweendeenda kwakwe wakasika kucisi catulundulundu twa-Efraimu, kuŋanda ya-Mika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Mika wakamubuzya kuti, Ino wazwidai? Wakati, Ndi mu-Levi waku-Betelehemu mucisi ca-Juda, Nja buyandaula busena bwakukala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
